  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. Tin whistle is a:\n\n- A) Fipple flute (aerophone)\n- B) Bowed string\n- C) Struck percussion\n- D) Keyboard\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. Most common session whistle key:\n\n- A) D\n- B) B♭\n- C) F♯\n- D) A♭\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q3. Boehm system improved flute keywork in the 19th century.\n\n**Answer:** True",
